- his guide of -30.15: S1 less Embraer's +2.11 until a volume is agreed.
His conditional vetoes are not triggered by hold. His floor test passes: no new R&D or strain, the 70% payout whole, and no rating risk (debt $35B against EV $160B).
I also took his candid point that the payout is whole but sits on a smaller base than the status quo.
